    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the balance thing, but isn't the \"gradual\" approach basically just a way to avoid doing what's actually necessary? like, if the climate catastrophe is as existential as everyone says, doesn't that make the economic stability argument kind of irrelevant in the long run?",
